      "category": "documentation",
      "category_description": "Function hashing, cross-binary documentation, undocumented function discovery",
      "description": "Ingest a single function's documentation into the cross-version archive (re_kb.functions on bsim Postgres). Idempotent; field-level merge resolution happens on the archive side. Use archive_ingest_program for bulk.",
