      "description": "List data items sorted by xref count (descending). By default returns only defined data items. `filter` and `type_filter` (each: all/defined/undefined) compose orthogonally to also include unnamed/untyped addresses — `filter=all,type_filter=all` returns the full data surface (named + DAT_*-style autogen + raw undefined-with-xrefs). `min_xrefs` (default 1) suppresses zero-xref noise on undefined items.",
